    altBackground: "#ffffff"
  themeCSS: |
    .actor-line {
      stroke-dasharray: 10 10 !important;
      stroke-width: 1.25px !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    actor Admin
    participant Page as Site page<br/>app/detail/[namesite]
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>SiteSafetyPriorityActions (proposed)
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>W26_site_safety (proposed)

    Note over Steward,DB: Covers US 2.0.11. No safety information exists in the code today.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over Steward,DB: Show safety information (AT 1, AT 2)
    Steward->>Page: Open a Site page
    Page->>Server: getSiteSafety(siteId) (proposed)
    Server->>DB: Read the W26_site_safety row for the Site
    DB-->>Server: nearest_hospital, hazards, other_info, or no row
    Server-->>Page: Safety values
    Page-->>Steward: Show each value. An empty value shows "Not recorded"

    Note over Steward,DB: Change safety information (AT 3, AT 4)
    Admin->>Page: Edit safety information and select Save
    Page->>Server: updateSiteSafety(siteId, fields) (proposed)
    Server->>Server: Check caller is Admin from a trusted role source
    alt Caller is not Admin (AT 4)
        Server-->>Page: Refused. Stored values stay the same
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: Upsert W26_site_safety row with updated_by and updated_at
        Server-->>Page: Saved
        Page-->>Admin: A reload shows the new values (AT 3)
    end

    Note over Steward,DB: Open questions: the list of safety fields (the story names nearest hospital<br/>and hazards), and if the nearest hospital is typed by an Admin or calculated from the Site location.
